  "description": "<p><span>I&rsquo;m Alexis Jae, but most people call me Lexi. My family&rsquo;s been manufacturing fine jewelry for generations.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span>One of my favorite things to do with friends is invite them to design their own jewelry with me and help them get it for around 50% less than it would be if they bought it from a store. And I realized: I can do this for everyone.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span>You see, when fine jewelry is made, it typically goes from a manufacturer (me), to a store, to you. By skipping the middleman (or middlemen, we should say), we&rsquo;re helping you get the jewelry you want, at a price that&rsquo;s hard to find.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span></span><span>Through Alexis Jae, you can save around 50% off traditional retail prices. And you can&nbsp;<span data-markjs=\"true\" class=\"markahoibruya\" data-ogac=\"\" data-ogab=\"\" data-ogsc=\"\" data-ogsb=\"\">feel good while doing it</span>&nbsp;because all of our gems are ethically sourced, all our gold is recycled, and a portion of our profits go towards breast cancer research.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span>And the best part is, you can make it exactly how you want it.</span></p>",
